        "description": {
          "en-US": "ImgCraft is an unofficial app for browsing Imgur, built on Imgur's v3 API. It is not\nmade by, endorsed by or affiliated with Imgur.\n\n* Feed, search, tags, posts, albums, videos and comments\n* Favourites in folders, follows and hidden users and tags, kept on the device\n* Import favourites, follows, blocked users and muted tags from an Imgur account\n* Vote, comment and reply once logged in\n* No ads, analytics or Google Play services\n\nImgCraft comes without an API key: paste the client ID of an Imgur API application in\nSettings."
        },
